      "label": "Chevy vs Ford mudding comparison scene",
      "description": "A two-panel meme scene comparing how Chevrolet and Ford owners approach off-roading. The top panel shows a muddy Chevrolet truck struggling through thick mud, representing 'how chevy guys go muddin'. The bottom panel shows a Ford truck dramatically kicking up mud in a wide-open field, representing 'how ford guys go muddin'. The scene uses visual contrast to imply a stereotype: Chevy owners are practical and gritty, while Ford owners are showy and dramatic.",
